  - Description: Metastatic anal cancer is treated first with platinum-based chemotherapy, called first-line therapy
  - Source: CHEMOTHERAPY
  - Target: METASTASIS
  - Description: Metastatic anal cancer is treated with platinum-based chemotherapy
  - Source: METASTASIS
