    <node id="APPOINTMENTS">
      <data key="d0">extracted</data>
      <data key="d1">APPOINTMENTS are scheduled clinical visits during which a patient meets with their care team to ask questions and discuss care. These interactions may take place in person as doctor visits or remotely as telehealth visits. Patients are encouraged to prepare for appointments by bringing someone for support and taking notes. Tracking appointments through a patient portal such as MyChart is recommended, as the portal helps patients keep track of scheduled visits and communicate with the care team. Overall, appointments are medical visits or meetings that patients should track and prepare for to ensure productive discussions about their care.
Relationships: (None listed in the provided data)</data>
