    <node id="HEPATITIS C">
      <data key="d3">6</data>
      <data key="d0">extracted</data>
      <data key="d1">Hepatitis C is a viral infection caused by the hepatitis C virus (HCV). It is known to cause chronic hepatitis, cirrhosis, liver failure, and liver cancer. In the context of chronic lymphocytic leukemia (CLL), hepatitis C is an infection that is specifically tested for before CLL treatment begins.
