ENTITY: TUMOR TESTING
Description: Also called somatic testing, molecular tumor testing, or tumor profiling; analyzes tumor tissue, metastatic biopsies, or blood containing tumor DNA to identify molecular markers and mutations in DNA repair genes
Relationships:
  - Source: TUMOR TESTING
  - Target: MUTATION
  - Description: Tumor testing looks for specific abnormalities and mutations in DNA repair genes
