  - Source: CANCER
  - Target: MUTATION
  - Description: Cancer begins with mutations in genes. These genetic mutations can cause cancer by disrupting normal cell regulation. Tumor tests can identify specific mutations, and those mutations can then be targeted with specific therapies.
