      <data key="d1">(Not in entity table; referenced in relationships.)
Relationships:
  - Source: BURKITT LEUKEMIA
  - Target: BURKITT LYMPHOMA
  - Description: Burkitt leukemia and Burkitt lymphoma are closely related conditions. Burkitt leukemia is essentially the same disease as Burkitt lymphoma, sharing the same underlying pathology. However, despite this fundamental similarity, the two are treated differently in clinical practice. The distinction reflects differences in how the disease presents and the treatment approach chosen, but the core disease process is considered the same entity.</data>
