      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The NCCN Guidelines for Patients: Squamous Cell Skin Cancer at NCCN.org provides treatment information for cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma of the vermilion lip.</data>
      <data key="d8">CUTANEOUS SQUAMOUS CELL CARCINOMA OF THE VERMILION LIP</data>
    </edge>
