    </edge>
    <edge source="IMAGING TESTS" target="ULTRASOUND" id="0">
      <data key="d5">related_to</data>
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">IMAGING TESTS encompass a range of diagnostic modalities, and ULTRASOUND is one such imaging test. In the context of prostate cancer, imaging methods include ultrasound as a diagnostic tool. Additionally, ultrasound is often the first imaging test used for ovarian cancer. Thus, ultrasound serves as a versatile imaging technique within the broader category of imaging tests, playing a key role in the evaluation of both prostate and ovarian cancers.</data>
      <data key="d8">ULTRASOUND</data>
    </edge>
