      <data key="d7">An eye exam is performed because primary CNS lymphoma can affect the eyes.</data>
      <data key="d8">PRIMARY CNS LYMPHOMA</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FERTILITY SPECIALIST" target="FERTILITY COUNSELOR" id="0">
      <data key="d5">related_to</data>
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Both fertility specialist and fertility counselor are fertility-related experts who can help the patient preserve fertility before or during cancer treatment.</data>
