    <edge source="NATIONAL COMPREHENSIVE CANCER NETWORK" target="ACUTE LYMPHOBLASTIC LEUKEMIA" id="0">
      <data key="d5">related_to</data>
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The National Comprehensive Cancer Network (NCCN) publishes patient care guidelines specifically for Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia (ALL). These NCCN Guidelines for Patients provide comprehensive information about ALL, including details on testing, treatment options, and supportive care.</data>
